      "help_en": "The filter conditions. The operators supported by int_attr include in, not in, greater-than sign (>), greater-than-or-equal-to sign (>=), less-than sign (<), less-than-or-equal-to sign (<=), and equal sign (=). The operators supported by str_attr include in, not in, equal sign (=), and not-equal sign (!=). Multiple conditions can be connected by using AND and OR.\nExamples:\nint_attr >= 100.\nstr_attr != \"value1\".\nint_attr = 1000 AND str_attr = \"value1\".\n\nA maximum of 4,096 characters are supported",
      "help_zh": "过滤条件。int_attr支持的操作符有in、not in、大于号(>)、大于等于号(>=)、小于号(<)、小于等于号(<=)、等于号(=)。str_attr支持的操作符有in、not in、等于号(=)和不等号(!=)，多个条件之间支持AND和OR进行连接。\n例如：\nint_attr >= 100。\nstr_attr != \"value1\"。\nint_attr = 1000 AND str_attr = \"value1\"。\n\n最多支持4096个字符",
